\begin{remark}
\label{topping-ch7-flow-backward-interval}
\source{topping:page-0083}
\dcref{ch7:2.2}
\group{compactness-flows}
This definition applies on an interval such as $(-\infty,0)$ when the
$i$-th flow is defined on $(-T_i,0)$ and $T_i\to\infty$.
\end{remark}

